  "description": "Ground Floor Conservatory Extension (Retrospective)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The single storey rear extension by reason of its excessive\r\ndepth, siting and poor materials in close proximity to No.6 Carlyon Avenue results\r\nin an overbearing visual impact to the detriment of the residential and visual\r\namenities of the occupiers of this neighbouring property. The proposal would\r\ntherefore be contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3\r\nof the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and\r\nadopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
